Nothing lives here any more, and that is deliberate.

The AI Sight workbook PDF is uploaded to Socioverse Planets secure storage,
attached to the zero-price DOWNLOAD product. Planets creates the order from the
billing email and sends the file - so the PDF is never served from this domain
and never sits in this repo.

This directory is kept only so the /downloads/ path still resolves if the file is
ever hosted here instead. See docs/workbook-endpoint.md.

Producing the PDF is handoff 01 in Socials/ai-sight-free-release/.
